# Trust: Abquhbah, the permit tests alone: Immortal Sentries completed, RoV at Ever Forward, the Windurst Trust Permit
# missing: the check fails: his script. The permit given (a GM): 170 ([1] 1, [2] 2, text_table 0); the permit taken
# again inside the open event (a GM): the check fails at the finish, so the handler is not called: no cipher. The
# check then fails again (no permit): his script.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Abquhbah/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/170
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=35.5,-6.6,-56.7 job=WAR lvl=99 nation=2
mission Toau ImmortalSentries completed
mission Rov EverForward current
login
trigger Abquhbah                        # no permit: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
keyitem WindurstTrustPermit             # a GM
trigger Abquhbah                        # 170 ([1] 1, [2] 2)
delkeyitem WindurstTrustPermit          # a GM, inside the open event
finish                                  # the check fails at the finish: no handler, no cipher
trigger Abquhbah                        # no permit: the check fails: his script
finish-if-event
